From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:59:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Prove SingleBitSecure.bitwise_padded_cpa

The hybrid argument over the n message bits: hybrids with eager coins,
the gap index j*(n) from exists_advantage_hybrid_gap, the T1
distinguisher planting the single-bit challenge at block j*, and the
exact identity advantage(H_j, H_{j+1}) = distAdv; the bound n * distAdv
is negligible by Negligible.polyExpr_mul.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
